  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Muli, sans-serif;\">From humble beginnings at plant fairs and pop-ups under railway arches, Bloombox Club now&nbsp;delivers thousands of plants across the UK, Ireland, Germany, France and Austria, every month. We truly love plants and also love the way they transform your home. That's why at Bloombox Club we want to give everyone this experience, help pick the right one for you and transform your home. And it&rsquo;s not just about the science, we&rsquo;re assiduous about the way our plants look too. Our very own plant specialists carefully select plants based on their rarity and quirkiness, as well as prettiness and substantial benefit to the surrounding environment. We always ensure ourselves to stay at the forefront of plant trends and acquire plants that are not readily available elsewhere in the UK or Europe and deliver them right to your door!</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Muli, sans-serif;\">Anyone can start caring for a plant no matter your experience level. We don&rsquo;t think you need a&nbsp;horticultural degree or mystical green thumb to look after plants, you just need to know the basic&nbsp;principles. You can find plant-specific and more substantial information on&nbsp;<a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color_link); text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://bloomboxclub.com/blogs/news\">our Blog &lsquo;The Green Room&rsquo;</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Muli, sans-serif;\">We welcome you to our community and hope you enjoy your journey into the world of indoor plants!</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 22px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Muli, sans-serif;\">Your Bloombox Club Team</p>",
